@name     wave_loop_count
@alias    BC
@group    osc
@c_name   skode_clause_wave_loop_count
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  set waveform loop repeat count
@doc
Sets maximum loop iterations before stopping.
Usage: BC count (or wave_loop_count count)
@code
    if (voice < 0 || voice >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    return wave_loop_count(voice, (int)args[0]);
@end
